<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Allen Code Co — sitemap.xml

  This file lives at https://www.allencodeco.com/sitemap.xml and is
  referenced from /robots.txt. Lists every public page on the site with
  priority hints so search engines understand the relative importance of
  each URL.

  PRIORITY MODEL
    1.0 — Homepage. The acquisition front door.
    0.9 — Founder portfolio (chris-allen-portfolio). Personal brand
          page that reinforces the studio's authority signal.
    0.9 — Products index. The "what we ship" overview.
    0.8 — Individual product showcases. Each product has acquisition
          and partnership value; high but below the index.
    0.3 — /thanks (form-submission confirmation). Listed for crawl
          completeness but low ranking weight; users only land there
          after submitting the contact form, never from search.

  CHANGE FREQUENCY
    Most pages are 'monthly'. The homepage is 'weekly' (closest to
    where new product additions or status updates land first).

  LAST MODIFIED
    Set to the date of this sitemap deploy. Crawlers use this as a
    "has anything changed?" hint. Update this file whenever a page is
    materially edited so re-crawling is prioritized.

  ROUTE NOTE
    The Vercel rewrite at /  →  /allen-code-co-animated.html means the
    canonical homepage URL is the bare apex (https://www.allencodeco.com/),
    NOT the underlying .html filename. Listing the bare URL here ensures
    crawlers index the user-facing canonical, not the internal alias.
-->
